    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to deal with the doctors right now everything is just so expensive and i feel like i can handle it myself. i've read that vitamin c is a huge antioxidant and helps with inflammation so it makes sense that it would help clear out the stones. if i take it with a lot of water won't that just offset the risk? its just a supplement, it can't be that bad right?",
